OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of rain in the north
OL,6,Fand strong winds. Rain could be heavy
OL,7,Fat times across northern England,
OL,8,FWales and the Midlands. Drier in the
OL,9,Fsouth and rather breezy, with some
OL,10,Fwarm sunny spells.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FWinds gradually easing
OL,13,Fovernight as rain moves further south.
OL,14,FStaying cloudy and humid in the south,
OL,15,Fbut fresher with clearer spells in the
OL,16,Fnorth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
