OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FCloud and outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Flinger in the south on Sunday, but
OL,7,Frain gradually easing. Still warm and
OL,8,Fhumid here. Drier, brighter and
OL,9,Ffresher in the north with sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
